sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Two TLS sessions and two certificate locations
accDescr: CloudFront terminates the viewer session using a us-east-1 certificate, then creates a distinct origin session to the ALB using its regional certificate.
participant V as Viewer
participant CF as CloudFront
participant ALB as ALB in eu-west-1
V->>CF: TLS to shop.example.com
Note over CF: Viewer certificate in ACM us-east-1
CF-->>V: Certificate covers shop.example.com
Note over CF: Viewer TLS terminates here
CF->>ALB: New TLS connection to origin.example.com
Note over ALB: Origin certificate in ACM eu-west-1
ALB-->>CF: Trusted certificate covers origin.example.com
Note over V,CF: Viewer policy is HTTPS Only
Note over CF,ALB: Origin policy is HTTPS Only
